{"id":"D16","kind":"DART 공시","title":"매출액또는손익구조30%(대규모법인은15%)이상변동","date":"2024-02-21","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20240221900455"},{"id":"D17","kind":"DART 공시","title":"회사합병결정(종속회사의주요경영사항)","date":"2023-05-31","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20230531900499"},{"id":"D18","kind":"DART 공시","title":"매출액또는손익구조30%(대규모법인은15%)이상변동","date":"2023-02-23","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20230223900602"},{"id":"R","kind":"DART 사업보고서","title":"사업보고서 (2024.12) 'II. 사업의 내용'","date":"2025-03-14","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20250314001215"}]}